  "text": "## Step 8: Customer Notification  \n### Closure Confirmation Letter  \n**Contents:**\n- Account number and product name\n- Closure date\n- Final balance\n- Payment method and timeline\n- Standing order/DD cancellation confirmation\n- Records retention notice (6 years archive)\n- Contact information (questions)  \n**Delivery:**\n- Email (if email on file)\n- Postal mail (required, to registered address)\n- Sent within 2 business days of closure  \n**Tone:** Professional, thanking customer for business  \n---",
